Status
------
Seeded on 10 November 2026 (milestone S0) from FART-next, tag FARG, commit
c13d8747c5d8f7e6abc91a0f871ec87eeafc77e3. The seeded files are the code
(adapters, assets, core, licenses, tests, tools, view, shell*.qml) and FART's
docs under docs/fart/.

Lineage (seeded at milestone S0)
--------------------------------------
- FART-next, the predecessor control centre (GPL-3.0). It descends from
  pctrade/end4-pC and end-4/dots-hyprland ("illogical-impulse"), both GPL-3.0,
  and includes a Caelestia shell asset (GPL-3.0). FART-next's own NOTICE lists
  the derived files. That NOTICE is carried over in full as
  licenses/FART-NOTICE.

Planned third-party use
-----------------------
- DMS, Dux Modular Shell (formerly DankMaterialShell),
  https://github.com/duxlabs-dev/dux-shell
  MIT licence, "Copyright (c) 2025 Avenge Media LLC".
  The `dms` backend is installed separately and used over its socket; it is not
  vendored. If any of its QML services are adapted (notifications, lock/PAM,
  idle, polkit), the MIT notice will be reproduced here, with each derived file
  listed.
- Yale Bright Star Catalogue (public domain) for the sky. Confirmed at
  milestone S8.

Read at runtime, not distributed
--------------------------------
- Serpantinum: colour presets, UI sounds, emoji data and the `serpantinum` PAM
  service file are read from the owner's local installation when present. No
  licence file was found in that installation, so none of these files are
  copied into this repository.

Design references
-----------------
Persona and NieR:Automata are named only as design inspiration. No names,
logos, fonts, artwork, sounds or layouts from them are used.

S3 visual review artifacts (11 November 2026)
-------------------------------------------
- docs/ui/island-s3-review.svg: original island design studies using the
  seeded FART Design tokens and geometric language; embeds a fixture-only
  screenshot of the seeded FART Timers panel (GPL-3.0 lineage above).
- docs/ui/island-s3-review.png: raster rendering of that SVG.
- docs/ui/island-s3-motion.gif: a motion study using the same island drawings
  with synthetic events and readings.
- docs/ui/contrast.txt: derived contrast ratios for the review token snapshot.
- docs/ui/fartland-fluid-study.svg: original Fluid mock-up with the same
  FART token snapshot, synthetic sky and event content.
- docs/ui/fartland-fluid-study.png and docs/ui/fartland-fluid-motion.gif:
  raster review renders of the Fluid drawings.
No new third-party imagery or fonts are bundled.
